test: blank lines and PP/P/LP delimit paragraphs without line-per-paragraph errors
-- options.json --
{"strict":true,"normalize":true}
-- input.1 --
.SH DESCRIPTION
first
paragraph

second paragraph
.P
third
.LP
fourth
